      "narrative": "I find myself standing within the confines of a cramped galley, where the pervasive salt seems to have invaded every nook and cranny. It's an environment of maritime labors past or present, filled with the relics of hurried activities. Holding a kettle in my hands, dented and clearly well-used, I have taken it upon myself to explore this space further. Having looked around and examined the kettle closely, my attention soon turns to the two exits: a doorway leading north and a hatch descending into the south. The kettle, despite its battered appearance, might serve as more than just a vessel for hot beverages; it could hold clues or even be a makeshift tool. As I shuffle with the kettle in my grasp, I decide my next move will be to venture northward, hoping to uncover more about this vessel's story and perhaps the crew who once navigated these waters.",
